  "visualAssessment": [
    "The new scalp paths reduce the frontal top plateau. In the fixed 720-pixel view the left near-apex span is 83 columns for r0507 B and 67 in A and B. The r0508 experiments reached 136 and 131 using the same metric.",
    "The narrower crown and shorter curtains give a visible local contour change. Both new versions develop an abrupt overhanging temple edge. The lifted strip is obvious beside the eyebrow from the side and appears like a cap in the held turn and blink.",
    "The posterior grooms remain readable and the whole figure is the same working woman. The complete hairstyle shows insufficient gain after the newly visible angular edge. Retain the measured scalp construction as research and reject both complete layouts."
  ],
